Bund_2Y_m ~ pureMP_m + Path_m + QE_m +
L(pureMP_m, 1:12) + L(Path_m, 1:12) + L(QE_m, 1:12) +
L(Bund_2Y_m, 1:12) + L(d_rGDP_m, 1:12) + L(d_HICP_m, 1:12),
data = shocks_ts
)
cat("\nFirst Stage Regression Results:\n")
